. di "INICIO DEL PROCESO DE ESTIMACIÓN DE PANEL - CANTONES DE ECUADOR"
INICIO DEL PROCESO DE ESTIMACIÓN DE PANEL - CANTONES DE ECUADOR

. di "======================================================================"
======================================================================

. 
. * Importar los datos de panel sanitizados
. import excel "../data/datos_de_panel_sanitized.xlsx", sheet("panel_data") firstrow clear
(10 vars, 2,210 obs)

. 
. * Generar variables transformadas logarítmicamente (elasticidades)
. gen log_ventas = log(ventas_totales)

. gen log_empresas = log(num_emp)

. gen log_empleo = log(empleo_prom)

. 
. * Configurar el panel de datos
. xtset canton_id year

Panel variable: canton_id (strongly balanced)
 Time variable: year, 2015 to 2024
         Delta: 1 unit

. 
. * Describir y resumir las variables del panel
. xtdes

canton_id:  101, 102, ..., 2403                              n =        221
    year:  2015, 2016, ..., 2024                             T =         10
           Delta(year) = 1 unit
           Span(year)  = 10 periods
           (canton_id*year uniquely identifies each observation)

